  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mekong Region: Responding to Cross Border Mobility Challenges at Points of Entry Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to respond to the immediate challenges across the Mekong countries by targeting points of entry through enhancing capacity of border officials, reducing risks at points of entry and supporting vulnerable migrants in order to ensure safe, regular and humane migration.</narrative>
  </description>
